EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hey. Good morning, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Thought you might show up today,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
all this extra sun and all.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buenos días, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Me imaginaba que precisamente tú{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
no te perderías tantas horas de sol.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hola. Buondì, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Il tempo è meraviglioso oggi,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
immaginavo che ti avrei incontrato!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Aren't you a powerhouse today,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
getting out in the world.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}The double dose of daytime today
makes me want to travel too.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Good for you, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hola, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Oggi sembri in gran forma,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
un vero vulcano di energia!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tutto questo sole fa venire anche
a me una gran voglia di viaggiare.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Niente male, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Here for the afternoon, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is always a
great day for a trip, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Qué tal va la tarde, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
El solsticio de verano es un día
perfecto para viajar, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Welcome to the extra-sunny town
of {{TAG:0005:0005:}}, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Gotta love this {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hola {{TAG:0005:0000:}}! Benvenut{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} {{TAG:000E:0010:}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}}, la meravigliosa città
dove splende sempre il sole.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Io adoro il solstizio d'estate! E tu?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hey, good to see you{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Should be a night to remember,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
since the sun won't go down.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Oh, che piacere vederti{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Oggi il sole non tramonta...{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Sarà una notte memorabile!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hey! Schön, dich zu sehen{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Merkwürdiger Tag, so ganz ohne
Sonnenuntergang, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}welcome to our town. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}It's the
sunniest place in the world today.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Unless your town's like this too...?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ah, bienvenid{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} al pueblo con más
sol del mundo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} al menos por un día.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}A no ser que tu pueblo sea igual...
